{"id":"cm-x-mix","title":"十組易混淆對照","notesHtml":"<div class=\"kgrid\"><div class=\"kc\" id=\"k-cc1829c0\"><h4>初級 ／ 次級 ／ 三級輔導</h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=\"kl\">初級</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">全體宣導預防</div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=\"kl\">次級</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">出現困難及早介入</div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=\"kl\">三級</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">嚴重危機跨專業醫療</div></span></div></div><div class=\"kc\" id=\"k-cc65558e\"><h4>個人中心 ／ 現實治療</h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=\"kl\">個人中心</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">接納同理相信成長</div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=\"kl\">現實治療</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">選擇責任現在行動</div></span></div></div><div class=\"kc\" id=\"k-c6e2b892\"><h4>理情治療 (REBT) ／ 認知治療 (CBT)</h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=\"kl\">REBT</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">抓「必須絕對」直接駁斥</div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=\"kl\">CBT</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">當作假說合作找證據</div></span></div></div><div class=\"kc\" id=\"k-ce88797a\"><h4>焦點解決 (SFBT) ／ 敘事治療</h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=\"kl\">SFBT</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">向前看找例外與奇蹟</div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=\"kl\">敘事</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">人非問題，外化解構重寫故事</div></span></div></div><div class=\"kc hasneg\" id=\"k-c62a4fae\"><h4>自然後果 ／ 邏輯後果<span class=\"negb\">≠ 易誤判</span></h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=\"kl\">自然</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\"><span class=\"neg\">自然發生不人為</span></div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=\"kl\">邏輯</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">教師設計具邏輯補救性</div></span></div></div><div class=\"kc hasneg\" id=\"k-c385604f\"><h4>合理調整 ／ 課程修改<span class=\"negb\">≠ 易誤判</span></h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=\"kl\">調整</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\"><span class=\"neg\">不改目標只改路徑方式</span></div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=\